{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>What is Star Catcher?</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We are <strong>The Fallow</strong>. A herbivorous and peaceful people. We have a duty: to be stewards of this sea and to free the souls lost within it.\u00a0They are the scattered star-lights in the sea and the sky. We free the souls by guiding them and offering passage to the gate at the centre of our world.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/71d34d65899e9a5bfb5e0a390cf2f2cf.poster.avif?t=1772501870\" width=892 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/71d34d65899e9a5bfb5e0a390cf2f2cf.webm?t=1772501870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/71d34d65899e9a5bfb5e0a390cf2f2cf.mp4?t=1772501870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAIN FEATURES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fish for Lost Souls!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish up lost souls by casting your rod into the sea of stars. The types of souls you catch and how you catch them are impacted by the parts of your rod that you have unlocked and equipped - as well as where you choose to fish. When a soul is guided to your lure, complete a fun fishing minigame to collect them.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/2f89dea6110cf9af9e6267d7f7f8f443.poster.avif?t=1772501870\" width=856 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/2f89dea6110cf9af9e6267d7f7f8f443.webm?t=1772501870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/2f89dea6110cf9af9e6267d7f7f8f443.mp4?t=1772501870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore an Archipelago Lost to Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travelling either by hoof or by sea to discover new areas, environments and fishing spots. New paths will unlock for you as you release more souls, and you might find unique hidden areas by keeping a keen eye out on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/8d5455e0929c9c91182ebf3bb09288b6.poster.avif?t=1772501870\" width=890 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/8d5455e0929c9c91182ebf3bb09288b6.webm?t=1772501870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/8d5455e0929c9c91182ebf3bb09288b6.mp4?t=1772501870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sail Alone or With Others!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your friends with you on your exploration of the cosmos! Catch souls together, show off your signature style, and explore using the unique mechanics that emerge when two or more fallow work together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow the World Alongside You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Release the souls you catch at the\u00a0Soul Gate\u00a0in order to receive pearls. As you release more souls to the gates, your environment will change. Then, you'll gain access to new areas, new NPC's and new souls. You'll be able to gift your pearls to NPC's you find along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build A Reputation\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your reputation among <i>Fallow</i> by offering them your pearls. Fallow may offer you new fishing gear, furniture, information and customisation options as you improve your relations with them and grow closer, together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customise Your Appearance!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself by fully customising your playthrough! Alter your character appearance or ship by unlocking and equipping different skin or clothing options; then build and customise your own personal room within the ship by collecting different furniture items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3993790?t=1772501870","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/257acd5ace30a5778b73757da0fa9e1bf92557f7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772501870","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/816362a49fd1f2e3b3af7075b5151770f9bde935/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772501870","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/816362a49fd1f2e3b3af7075b5151770f9bde935/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772501870","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>What is Star Catcher?</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We are <strong>The Fallow</strong>. A herbivorous and peaceful people. We have a duty: to be stewards of this sea and to free the souls lost within it.\u00a0They are the scattered star-lights in the sea and the sky. We free the souls by guiding them and offering passage to the gate at the centre of our world.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/71d34d65899e9a5bfb5e0a390cf2f2cf.poster.avif?t=1772501870\" width=892 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/71d34d65899e9a5bfb5e0a390cf2f2cf.webm?t=1772501870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/71d34d65899e9a5bfb5e0a390cf2f2cf.mp4?t=1772501870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAIN FEATURES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fish for Lost Souls!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish up lost souls by casting your rod into the sea of stars. The types of souls you catch and how you catch them are impacted by the parts of your rod that you have unlocked and equipped - as well as where you choose to fish. When a soul is guided to your lure, complete a fun fishing minigame to collect them.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/2f89dea6110cf9af9e6267d7f7f8f443.poster.avif?t=1772501870\" width=856 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/2f89dea6110cf9af9e6267d7f7f8f443.webm?t=1772501870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/2f89dea6110cf9af9e6267d7f7f8f443.mp4?t=1772501870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore an Archipelago Lost to Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travelling either by hoof or by sea to discover new areas, environments and fishing spots. New paths will unlock for you as you release more souls, and you might find unique hidden areas by keeping a keen eye out on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/8d5455e0929c9c91182ebf3bb09288b6.poster.avif?t=1772501870\" width=890 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/8d5455e0929c9c91182ebf3bb09288b6.webm?t=1772501870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/8d5455e0929c9c91182ebf3bb09288b6.mp4?t=1772501870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sail Alone or With Others!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your friends with you on your exploration of the cosmos! Catch souls together, show off your signature style, and explore using the unique mechanics that emerge when two or more fallow work together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow the World Alongside You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Release the souls you catch at the\u00a0Soul Gate\u00a0in order to receive pearls. As you release more souls to the gates, your environment will change. Then, you'll gain access to new areas, new NPC's and new souls. You'll be able to gift your pearls to NPC's you find along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build A Reputation\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your reputation among <i>Fallow</i> by offering them your pearls. Fallow may offer you new fishing gear, furniture, information and customisation options as you improve your relations with them and grow closer, together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customise Your Appearance!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself by fully customising your playthrough! Alter your character appearance or ship by unlocking and equipping different skin or clothing options; then build and customise your own personal room within the ship by collecting different furniture items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Still Rain"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/ae07fe182dafc0a6922da92200da6279864db132/header.jpg?t=1772501870","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Star Catcher","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel i7 7800k or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 6GB or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Still Rain"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/b314be1b269fb7522e86a62159eeb0a01eb44bf0/ss_b314be1b269fb7522e86a62159eeb0a01eb44bf0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772501870","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/b314be1b269fb7522e86a62159eeb0a01eb44bf0/ss_b314be1b269fb7522e86a62159eeb0a01eb44bf0.600x338.jpg?t=1772501870"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/7880fb934fd82859a6940e1db2ac757ef6d68478/ss_7880fb934fd82859a6940e1db2ac757ef6d68478.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772501870"